# The root .gitignore's quarterly-round block (issues/WHU-Q1-*/...) does not match WHU-L1-*: these are its
# patterns, so audit and ruling logs and every file that quotes source passages are never committed for this
# lean-test issue. They are archived privately; only a sha256 manifest (private_manifest.txt) is committed.
# Added 2026-11-05 by Claude Code, session LT (the scoring side); the root .gitignore is unchanged.
audit/
rulings/
export/
bindings.json
gate-findings.json
quotations.json
conclusion-review.json
change-reviews.json
draft/*.gate.json*
advocate/
